flowchart TD
    FILE["Config file path"] --> EXT{"extension?"}

    EXT -->|".yaml .yml"| READ["Read first 5 non-comment lines"]
    EXT -->|".json etc"| LEGACY["return LegacyJson"]

    READ --> SCAN{"contains version:?"}
